{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q5", "domain": "relationship", "question": "在2022壬寅年，以下哪项是命主的婚姻经历？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命盘分析，命主八字伤官重重，对婚姻易生不满，有自我放纵的倾向；紫微斗数中，本命疾厄宫武曲贪狼带红鸾、天姚等桃花星，显示命主本身桃花较旺。2022壬寅年，流年疾厄宫武曲化忌，引动贪狼桃花劫，暗示命主的隐秘情感遭遇危机。同时，流年夫妻宫的天梁星恰逢化禄，天梁为解厄与宽恕之星，表示婚姻危机最终能被化解，得到原谅。综合判断，此年应为命主外遇被丈夫发现，但最终获得原谅，未走向离婚。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1c", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q5", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1c_R2_P1_G0\\details_2024_b1c_R2_P1_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 52304, "response_id": "d2889647-5dfd-495a-b60a-2469b4e44bcb", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 803, "completion_tokens": 3062, "total_tokens": 3865, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 768}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2912}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 768, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 35}}
